  "mtp_direct: every measured MTP split at every fill, its per-pass cycles against the adopted split at fill 1 added to the headline MTP pass time (tau / rate);",
  "victim delays are charged in full to the victim's token (every delayed collective assumed on its critical path): conservative; the campaign also records the critical-path-only figure."
